{"id":"actuel","lemma":"actuel","pos":"adj","rank":3298,"glosses":["current"],"ipa":"/ak.tɥɛl/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/08/Fr-actuel.ogg/Fr-actuel.ogg.mp3","forms":{"feminine":"actuelle","masculinePlural":"actuels","femininePlural":"actuelles"},"formAudio":{"actuelle":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4f/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Sartus85-actuelle.wav","actuels":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d2/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-actuels.wav","actuelles":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/06/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-DenisdeShawi-actuelles.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Quelle est la situation actuelle ?","en":"What's the current situation?","words":[{"g":"which?"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"situation"},null]},{"text":"Je vais quitter mon emploi actuel.","en":"I am going to leave my present job.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to go","l":"aller"},{"g":"to leave, to quit"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"job"},null]},{"text":"Je suis content de ma situation actuelle.","en":"I'm content with my current position.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},{"g":"content"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"my","l":"mon"},{"g":"situation"},null]},{"text":"Le président actuel a beaucoup d'ennemis.","en":"The current president has many enemies.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"president"},null,{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"much, very much, a lot"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"enemy","l":"ennemi"}]},{"text":"Les règles actuelles sont trop laxistes.","en":"The current rules are too lax.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"rule, regulation","l":"règle"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"too"},null]}]}